{"content": """"Pseudo-legal move generation and perft for a small chess engine.

Supports normal piece movement, captures, pawn double pushes, and
castling (both wings, both colors). A side may not castle out of
check, through an attacked square, or into check, and the squares
between king and rook must be empty.

